          {
            "title": "Question: Any number",
            "id": 73310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaką maksymalną liczbę wartości może przechowywać tablica?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tak wiele, ile chcemy</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">10</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tak wiele, ile chcemy.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tablica playlisty rośnie z 3 do 12 utworów. Czy ta sama tablica może pomieścić wszystkie 12?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tak, tablica może przechowywać tyle wartości, ile potrzebujemy</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nie, tablica może przechowywać tylko jedną wartość</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nie, tablica przestaje przyjmować wartości po dziesiątej</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Tak, ale dopiero po zastąpieniu trzech pierwotnych utworów</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tak, tablica może przechowywać tyle wartości, ile potrzebujemy.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Element",
            "id": 73903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Czym jest element?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Wartość w tablicy</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tablica</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Warunek tablicy</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wartość w tablicy.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Która z odpowiedzi jest elementem w <code>const scores = [8, 10, 9]</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Wartość <code>10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Cała tablica <code>[8, 10, 9]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Indeks używany do znalezienia <code>10</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Nazwa zmiennej <code>scores</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz Wartość <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Value in an array",
            "id": 73269,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Przypisz do zmiennej <code>toDo</code> tablicę z wartością <code>\"Feed Clawdius\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Feed Clawdius&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;To Do:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Feed Darian&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"To Do:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[ 'Feed Clawdius' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>[</code>, następnie <code>\"Feed Clawdius\"</code> i na końcu <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Square brackets",
            "id": 73271,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Utwórz tablicę przechowującą <code>\"classic\"</code> i <code>\"dark mode\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(themes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'classic', 'dark mode' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>[</code>, a następnie <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Utwórz tablicę przechowującą <code>\"classic\"</code> i <code>\"dark mode\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(themes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"theme\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"styles\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"modes\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'classic', 'dark mode' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>themes</code>, następnie <code>[</code> i na końcu <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Empty array",
            "id": 73313,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shoppingList = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(shoppingList);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\" ]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ shoppingList ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyobraź sobie, że przed wyświetleniem tablicy dodajesz <code>\"milk\"</code> za pomocą <code>.push()</code>. Co pokaże konsola?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shoppingList = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(shoppingList);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[ \"milk\" ]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\", \"milk\" ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>[ \"milk\" ]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Start at zero",
            "id": 73926,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki jest indeks elementu <code>\"lightBlue\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" colorScheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;grey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Które wyrażenie pobiera <code>\"lightBlue\"</code> z tablicy <code>colorScheme</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" colorScheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;grey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>colorScheme[0]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme[1]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme[-1]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme(0)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>colorScheme[0]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Change value",
            "id": 73974,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zaktualizuj drugi element na <code>\"Lee\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" missedCalls = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lou&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Zoe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"missedCalls[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(missedCalls);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"missedCalls[2]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Robert&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Lou', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>missedCalls[1]</code>, następnie <code>=</code> i na końcu <code>\"Lee\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Valid index",
            "id": 73931,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki jest ostatni indeks, do którego możemy uzyskać dostęp w tej tablicy?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ordersDelivered = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tablica zawiera trzy wartości dostawy, a indeksowanie zaczyna się od <code>0</code>. Który ostatni indeks jest prawidłowy?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ordersDelivered = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code>, czyli indeks trzeciej wartości</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>, ponieważ tablica zawiera trzy wartości</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code>, ponieważ ostatnią wartością jest <code>true</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code>, ponieważ liczą się tylko wartości <code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>2</code>, czyli indeks trzeciej wartości.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Start at zero",
            "id": 73980,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wpisz <code>\"Meg\"</code> pod indeksem <code>0</code> i <code>\"Max\"</code> pod indeksem <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Meg', 'Max' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"Meg\"</code>, a następnie <code>\"Max\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wpisz <code>\"Meg\"</code> pod indeksem <code>0</code> i <code>\"Max\"</code> pod indeksem <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"shift\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Meg', 'Max' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"Meg\"</code>, a następnie <code>\"Max\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Access element",
            "id": 73925,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak uzyskać dostęp do wartości <code>22</code> w tej tablicy?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bingoAnswer = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bingoAnswer[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer(2)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>bingoAnswer[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wartość <code>22</code> jest trzecia w tablicy <code>bingoAnswer</code>. Które wyrażenie ją pobiera?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bingoAnswer = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bingoAnswer[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer(2)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[22]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>bingoAnswer[2]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pop",
            "id": 74092,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co robi <code>.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Usuwa ostatnią wartość tablicy</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Usuwa pierwszą wartość tablicy</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Usuwa losową wartość z tablicy</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Usuwa ostatnią wartość tablicy.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wywołujesz <code>tasks.pop()</code> na tablicy <code>[\"email\", \"call\", \"meeting\"]</code>. Co się stanie?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Metoda usunie i zwróci <code>\"meeting\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Metoda usunie i zwróci <code>\"email\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Metoda usunie losowo jedno z trzech zadań</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Metoda zwróci <code>3</code> i pozostawi wszystkie trzy zadania</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Metoda usunie i zwróci <code>\"meeting\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Push",
            "id": 74095,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co robi <code>.push()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dodaje wartość do tablicy</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Usuwa wartość z tablicy</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tworzy tablicę</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dodaje wartość do tablicy.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co stanie się z tablicą <code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\"]</code> po wykonaniu <code>forecast.push(\"windy\")</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Zmieni się w <code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\", \"windy\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Zmieni się w <code>[\"sunny\", \"windy\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Powstanie osobna tablica <code>[\"windy\"]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Zmieni się w <code>[\"windy\", \"sunny\", \"cloudy\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Zmieni się w <code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\", \"windy\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Push",
            "id": 74090,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj <code>\"windy\"</code> do tej tablicy prognozy pogody.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" forecast = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sunny&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cloudy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"forecast.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;windy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(forecast);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'sunny', 'cloudy', 'windy' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>forecast</code>, następnie <code>.</code>, a potem <code>push</code>, <code>\"windy\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of the array",
            "id": 74094,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki jest indeks <code>\"salami\"</code> w tablicy po dodaniu go za pomocą <code>push()</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toppings = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;mozarella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toppings.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;salami&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toppings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[ 'mozarella', 'salami' ]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Który indeks pozwoli pobrać <code>\"salami\"</code> po pokazanym wywołaniu <code>push()</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toppings = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;mozarella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toppings.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;salami&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toppings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[ 'mozarella', 'salami' ]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>toppings.push[1]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store removed element",
            "id": 74091,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
