            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Która odpowiedź prawidłowo opisuje <code>digit</code> i <code>doorCode</code> po pokazanym wywołaniu <code>pop()</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doorCode = [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" digit = doorCode.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(digit);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">digit ma wartość 1, a doorCode to [2, 5, 0, 0]</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">digit ma wartość 1, a doorCode to [2, 5, 0, 0, 1]</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">digit ma wartość 1, a doorCode to [5, 0, 0, 1]</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">digit ma wartość 0, a doorCode to [2, 5, 0, 1]</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">digit ma wartość 1, a doorCode to [2, 5, 0, 0].</p></body></html>",
