            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co ten fragment kodu wyświetli w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" family = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frank&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Monica&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Fiona&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lip&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(family.length);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"6\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Które imiona pozostaną po obu wywołaniach <code>pop()</code> i jaka długość zostanie wyświetlona?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" family = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frank&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Monica&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Fiona&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lip&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(family.length);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Pozostaną Frank i Monica, a wyświetlona zostanie wartość <code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Pozostaną Frank, Monica i Fiona, a wyświetlona zostanie wartość <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Pozostaną wszystkie cztery imiona, a wyświetlona zostanie wartość <code>4</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Pozostaną Fiona i Lip, a wyświetlona zostanie wartość <code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pozostaną Frank i Monica, a wyświetlona zostanie wartość <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
